<title>USA: Athena Medical gets patent.</title>
<headline>Athena Medical gets patent.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athena Medical Corp said the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office has issued a patent for the company's biodegradable feminine protection product, Fresh 'n Fit Natural Padettes.</p>
<p>The patent is titled &quot;Biodegradable Feminine Hygiene Interlabia Pads and Method and Apparatus for Making Same.&quot;</p>
<p>Athena Medical introduced Natural Padettes in September. They are a 100 percent biodegradable extension of the company's Fresh 'n Fit Padettes, it said.</p>
</text>
